####################################################
##  Update information for NConf 1.3.1 to 2.0.0   ##
####################################################

##------------------------------------------------##
##       Changes to the NConf configuration       ##
##------------------------------------------------##

None.

##------------------------------------------------##
##     Changes to the generated configuration     ##
##------------------------------------------------##

None.

##------------------------------------------------##
##              Additional changes                ##
##------------------------------------------------##

Bridging entry only. This fork's version number jumped from 1.3.1 directly
to 2.0.0 without ever shipping an UPDATE/1.3.1_to_2.0.0 folder, which left
installations below 2.0.0 with no way to reach any later update (including
2.0.0_to_2.1.0) - the update chain matches installed_version against update
folder names and stops the moment no folder picks up where the previous one
left off.

This folder intentionally contains no SQL and no version_check.php, mirroring
the existing 1.3.0_to_1.3.1 folder's pattern for a version-only step with no
actual database change.

####################################################
##           End of update information            ##
####################################################
